{"flags":[[1000000,0],[1000001,0],[1000002,0],[1000003,0],[1000004,0],[1000005,0],[1000006,0],[1000007,0],[1000008,0],[1000009,0],[1000010,0],[1000011,0],[1000012,0],[1000013,0],[1000014,0],[1000015,-1],[1000016,0],[1000017,500],[1000018,0],[1000019,0],[1000020,4],[1000021,99000008],[1000022,4],[1000023,99000023],[1000024,4],[1000025,99000009],[1000026,50],[1000027,4],[1000028,99000016],[1000029,3],[1000030,40000009],[1000031,0],[1000032,0],[1000033,1],[1000034,2],[1000035,3],[1000036,4],[1000037,5],[1000038,6],[1000039,7],[1000040,8],[1000041,9],[1000042,10],[1000043,11],[1000044,12],[1000045,13],[1000046,14],[1000047,15],[1000048,34],[1000049,35],[1000050,36],[1000051,77],[1000052,78],[1000053,33],[1000054,27],[1000055,28],[1000056,38],[1000057,39],[1000058,3],[1000059,25],[1000060,26],[1000061,30],[1000062,37],[1000063,10],[1000064,40],[1000065,41],[1000066,42],[1000067,43],[1000068,53],[1000069,80],[1000070,51],[1000071,24],[1000072,64]],"messages":{"1000000":"Ponse, Village of Dwarves\n","1000001":"Ponse, Village of Dwarves\n","1000002":"Who are you?\nDon't bother me if you don't have anything important to say.\n","1000003":"You want an all-purpose antidote?\n","1000004":"It's a little expensive.\n","1000005":"Will the Noils pay for it?\n","1000006":"Umm... OK.\nHowever, the medicine isn't perfect.\n","1000007":"I don't have Ponero fruit,\na necessary ingredient for the antidote.\n","1000008":"The trees in Ponero Cave bear the fruit.\nThe cave is located to the south of Moldona Peninsula...\n","1000009":"Do you think you can gather some of that fruit?\n","1000010":"As soon as you get it,\nI will concoct the antidote.\n","1000011":"Yes, you've got it!\nLet me prepare it for you.\n","1000012":"...\n","1000013":"...\n","1000014":"There you go!\nAn all-purpose antidote.\n","1000015":"And since you provided the fruit,\nI won't charge you for the anitdote.\n","1000016":"What can I help you with?\n","1000017":"You've got more Ponero fruit?\nWhat, you need more antidote?\n","1000018":"Well, don't lose it this time.\n","1000019":"Looking to buy something?\n \n \u30fb~Buy Armaments         ~\n \u30fb~Buy Equipment         ~\n \u30fb~Identify Items        ~\n \u30fb~Repair Items          ~\n                                 ~QUIT~\n","1000020":" \u30fb~Arms               %9d Gold~\n \u30fb~Head Armor         %9d Gold~\n \u30fb~Body Armor         %9d Gold~\n \u30fb~Shield             %9d Gold~\n \u30fb~Leg Armor          %9d Gold~\n \u30fb~All Equipped Items %9d Gold~\n \u30fb~Non-Equipped Items %9d Gold~\n                           ~QUIT~\n","1000021":"Not enough money.\n","1000022":"Everything seems fine.\n","1000023":"To identify your item, it costs %d in Gold.  OK?\n \n                                 ~YES~  ~NO~\n","1000024":"You don't have anything that's unknown.\n","1000025":"I'm Munza.\nI'm excited to be doing business in this village of dwarves.\n","1000026":"Dwarves only use axes,\nand axes are the only weapons I have.\n","1000027":"We also have various kinds of medicine\nsince there is a pharmacist here.\n","1000028":"My name is Cindy.\nI'm the holy spirit witch for this village.\n","1000029":"You're so lucky you don't live here. It's\nboring as heck!\n","1000030":"Holy spirits! Heal their wounds!\n","1000031":"You seem all right.\n","1000032":"Are you a hired warrior?\nI'm Borunza, the blacksmith.\n","1000033":"I like antiques.\nIf you ever find an Ancient Short Sword,\nI might be able to work something out for you.\n","1000034":"Thanks.\n","1000035":"Oh, man! That's it!\nThat's an Ancient Short Sword!\n","1000036":"I owe you big time!\n","1000037":"From now on, I'll fix everything for you for free.\n","1000038":"Bring whatever you want repaired and I'll\ntake care of it, alright?\n","1000039":"Mmm...\n","1000040":"I'll let you in on a secret.\n","1000041":"Somebody said that some Vitality Potion can be found in the Ruins of Carn\nin the Mesrald Burial Grounds.\n","1000042":"And who are you?\n","1000043":"Somebody said that a vendor who sells tablets\nlives in Wog Cave in the Valley of Dying People.\n","1000044":"If you have time, why don't you go there?\n","1000045":"Hello.\n","1000046":"Somebody said there's a vendor\nwho sells capsules in Mour Cave on Lunafuld Beach.\n","1000047":"There's lots of odd people in this world.\n","1000048":"Are you talking to me?\n","1000049":"I'd sure like to eat some matrimony vine.\n","1000050":"Somebody said that we could get them at the Goldo Ruins by the Road of Atonement.\n","1000051":"Mmm...\n","1000052":"If I had Akebi fruit...\nMmm...\n","1000053":"Mmmm...!?\n","1000054":"That must be Akebi fruit.\nTell me where you got that! Ah, never mind.\nIt's no big deal.\n","1000055":"If let me take that off your hands,\nI'll give you something rare in exchange.\n","1000056":"Do you need me for something?\n","1000057":"I've heard of a wise man\nwho studies the remains of this world.\n","1000058":"I wonder what kind of studying he's doing\nright now?\n","1000059":"Hey, how are you?\n","1000060":"You're the hired warrior who's been searching around\nThe Ruins of The Wise, aren't you?\n","1000061":"If you give me 80,000 in gold, I'll tell you something interesting.\nHow about it?\n           ~YES~  ~NO~\n","1000062":"You're a warrior.\n","1000063":"You're something special.\n","1000064":"Get on the Warp Rune there.\n","1000065":"Don't give up.\n","1000066":"You don't have enough money.\n","1000067":"I've got some nice things.\n"},"status":[[0,7,4294967295,0],[0,3,10000000,2],[0,3,10000001,3],[0,5,4294967295,5],[0,0,12000000,9],[0,1,12000000,21],[0,0,12000001,32],[0,1,12000001,35],[0,0,12000002,94],[0,1,12000002,102],[0,0,12000003,107],[0,1,12000003,113],[0,0,12000004,121],[0,1,12000004,124],[0,0,12000005,129],[0,1,12000005,132],[0,0,12000006,137],[0,1,12000006,140],[0,0,12000007,145],[0,1,12000007,148],[0,0,12000008,153],[0,1,12000008,160],[0,0,12000009,167],[0,1,12000009,168],[0,0,12000010,173],[0,1,12000010,178],[0,0,12000100,194],[0,1,12000100,195],[0,